# The generator always emits LF. Pin the whole tool tree to LF so committed
# fixtures and boards match a fresh generation byte-for-byte regardless of a
# contributor's core.autocrlf. The drift-gate is EOL-tolerant as well, but pinning
# keeps the committed reference boards stable.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
